+++- Modified: `C:\ebt-emdash\emdash-plugin-store\tests\helpers.ts` (`makeCtx` now returns a `request: Request` with a configurable `Origin` header, defaulting to `"https://example.com"` — the plugin's own `DEFAULT_SETTINGS.siteOrigin` — so existing tests that don't care about origin are unaffected)
+++
+++## Precedent read and followed
